  "instructions": [
    "Heat 1 tablespoon coconut oil in a pan over medium heat.",
    "Add mustard seeds, cumin seeds, coriander seeds, and fenugreek seeds, and saut\u00199 until seeds crackle.",
    "Add chili peppers and curry leaves, and saut\u00199 for 1 minutes.",
    "Add peanuts and saut\u00199 for 3-4 minutes until they start to brown.",
    "Add tamarind paste, salt, and water, and mix well.",
    "Bring mixture to a boil, then reduce heat to low and simmer for 15 minutes.",
    "Heat 1 tablespoon ghee in a separate pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the cooked peanut mixture and stir well.",
    "Season with salt to taste.",
    "Serve in a scallop shell and garnish with coriander leaves.",
    "Double-fry the peanuts by frying them twice at high heat, once raw and once cooked, to achieve the signature crunchy texture."
